  "description": "Tenzir detection-node operation: per-pipeline ingest/egress rates, heartbeat, errors, and sigma detections. Pushed by the tenzir node's metrics pipelines via to_prometheus (Mimir remote-write); pipeline metrics are per-10s deltas. The three metrics pipelines themselves appear in the rate/heartbeat panels (self-reporting).",
